      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On the test avatar, the audio doesn't pop if the rifle has a custom volume rolloff that falls to 0 instead of the default logarithmic. \n\n[Potentially related canny](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/bug-audio-source-pops-and-cracks-when-animated) \n\nOn my test avatar, I'm also animating the pitch but it should only be adjusted when not firing in the state before. Maybe it's the previous audio playing on that source popping?",
